; Rival - cocky, restless E minor. Its opening phrase returns in battle_rival. Original composition, CC0-1.0.
#title Always One Step Ahead
#tempo 152
#time 4/4
#key E minor
#inst 1 duty=2 env=12,-3 rel=-1 vib=20,14,6
#inst 2 duty=1 env=6,-1
#inst 3 wave=6 env=12,0
#def R o4 l16 [c e g > c <]4 l8
#def r o4 l16 [c d+ g > c <]4 l8
#def R2 o4 l16 [c e g > c <]2 l8
#def ob o2 [c8 > c8 <]4
#def ob2 o2 [c8 > c8 <]2
#def bt K8 H8 S8 H8 K16 K16 H8 S8 H8
#def fl K8 H8 S8 H8 S16 S16 S16 S16 S8 S8
#def ma o5 e8 r8 e8 g8 r8 b4 a8 | o5 g8 r8 g8 e8 r8 c4 d8 | o5 f+8 r8 f+8 a8 r8 o6 d4 c8 | o5 b4. a8 f+4 d+4 | o5 e8 r8 e8 g8 r8 b4 o6 c8 | o6 c8 r8 c8 o5 b8 r8 a4 g8 | o5 g4 e4 f+4 d+4 | o5 e2 r8 b8 a8 b8 |
#def mb o5 g4. a8 b4 o6 d4 | o6 c4. o5 b8 a4 f+4 | o5 e8 a8 o6 c8 e8 d4 c4 | o5 b2 g4 e4 | o5 e8 g8 o6 c8 e8 d4 c4 | o5 a2 f+4 d4 | o5 d+4 f+4 b4 a4 | o5 b8 a8 g8 f+8 e8 f+8 g8 a8 |
#def ha k4{r} | k0{R} | k2{R} | k-1{R} | k4{r} | k-3{r} | k0{R2} k-1{R2} | k4{r} | k0
#def hb k-5{R} | k2{R} | k-3{r} | k4{r} | k0{R} | k2{R} | k-1{R} | k-1{R} | k0
#def ba k4{ob} | k0{ob} | k2{ob} | k11{ob} | k4{ob} | k9{ob} | k0{ob2} k11{ob2} | k4{ob} | k0
#def bb k7{ob} | k2{ob} | k9{ob} | k4{ob} | k0{ob} | k2{ob} | k11{ob} | k11{ob} | k0

A @1 $ {ma} {mb} {ma}
